      "decision": "accepted",
      "assessment": "The Task opts in to task-quality-1 explicitly. Submission binds every official output of the current round; captures of the same Action cannot inflate the output set. Independent Review is an explicit quality stage, and unrelated legacy Review does not promote a Task.",
      "run_labels": [
